sequenceDiagram
    participant Subscriber as Event Subscriber
    participant NotifMod as Notification Module
    participant SGSvc as SendgridNotificationService
    participant SendGridSDK as @sendgrid/mail
    participant SendGrid as SendGrid API

    Note over Subscriber,SendGrid: Triggered by order.placed event
    Subscriber->>NotifMod: createNotifications({ to, template, data, channel: "email", provider_id: "sendgrid" })
    NotifMod->>NotifMod: route to sendgrid provider
    NotifMod->>SGSvc: send(notification)

    SGSvc->>SGSvc: validate notification present
    SGSvc->>SGSvc: map attachments\n(content, filename, content_type, disposition)
    SGSvc->>SGSvc: resolve sender\nnotification.from?.trim() || config_.from

    alt notification has "content" field (inline HTML mode)
        SGSvc->>SGSvc: mailContent = { subject, html }
    else template mode
        SGSvc->>SGSvc: mailContent = { templateId: notification.template }
    end

    alt provider_data.personalizations present
        SGSvc->>SGSvc: message = { from, dynamicTemplateData,\nattachments, personalizations, ...mailContent }
    else no personalizations
        SGSvc->>SGSvc: message = { from, dynamicTemplateData,\nattachments, to: notification.to, ...mailContent }
    end

    SGSvc->>SendGridSDK: mail.send(message)
    SendGridSDK->>SendGrid: POST /v3/mail/send (JSON body)

    alt SendGrid returns 2xx
        SendGrid-->>SendGridSDK: 202 Accepted
        SendGridSDK-->>SGSvc: [response, body]
        SGSvc-->>NotifMod: {} (success)
        NotifMod->>NotifMod: mark notification delivered
    else SendGrid returns error
        SendGrid-->>SendGridSDK: 4xx / 5xx { errors: [{ message }] }
        SendGridSDK-->>SGSvc: throws error { code, response.body.errors }
        SGSvc->>SGSvc: extract errorCode + first error message
        SGSvc-->>NotifMod: throws MedusaError(UNEXPECTED_STATE,\n"Failed to send email: {code} - {message}")
        NotifMod->>NotifMod: mark notification failed
    end

    NotifMod-->>Subscriber: notification result
